                Amina's Heritage Kitchen
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mt-1.5 leading-relaxed"
               x-text="($store.app.language === 'ar' ? chef.chefNameAr : chef.chefName) + ' · ' + ($store.app.language === 'ar' ? chef.pickupAreaAr : chef.pickupArea)">
                Chef Amina Mansour · Maadi, Cairo
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-8 space-y-10">
